# Infrastructure (feature module)

## Dependency rule

Allowed: feature `domain` / `application` ports, `@shared/*`, Nest, Prisma (inside persistence), Socket.IO/SSE adapters.

Forbidden: presentation DTO shaping inside repos; `@prisma/client` leaked outside infrastructure; silent contract fallbacks; business policies in adapters.

## Folders

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `modules/<entity>/` | Nest composition (repos, UC useFactory, ports) |
| `persistence/repositories/` | Prisma repos, relations validation, write-error mappers |
| `persistence/row-mappers/` | Prisma row → domain |
| `web-socket/` / `sse/` | Realtime publisher adapters |
| other adapters | Implement application ports only |

## Do not

- ACL / orchestration → domain / application
- HTTP response shaping → presentation
- Re-register globals (`PrismaService`, `TRANSACTION_MANAGER_TOKEN`) in every feature
